{"unit_id":"truelove-dreamer__dsh-plugin-hooks#card-zh","repo":"truelove-dreamer/dsh-plugin-hooks","commit":"6cf763e7d6fe59b26937c3e07a17687474018de5","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-hooks 是面向 DSH 的工具生命周期钩子插件，可在匹配的模型工具执行前或执行后运行配置的 shell 命令，并通过 stdin 传递 JSON 上下文。它接入工具执行前后流程，支持按工具名筛选、设置超时与启用状态；前置钩子非零退出会阻止工具调用，后置钩子只记录结果。插件还提供查看钩子及近期运行记录、重新加载配置的命令，适合希望自动检查或拦截工具操作的 DSH 用户。需要宿主挂载 shell 服务，并配置 hooks.json 或内联钩子。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:143-189","lib/config.js:25-49"]}
{"unit_id":"truelove-dreamer__dsh-plugin-hooks#card-en","repo":"truelove-dreamer/dsh-plugin-hooks","commit":"6cf763e7d6fe59b26937c3e07a17687474018de5","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-plugin-hooks runs configured shell commands before or after DSH tool calls, passing JSON context on stdin. Failed pre hooks block calls; post hook results are recorded. It also lists recent runs and reloads hook settings. Requires the host shell service and hook configuration.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:143-189","lib/config.js:25-49"]}
