{"unit_id":"truelove-dreamer__dsh-plugin-hooks#feature-pre-hook","repo":"truelove-dreamer/dsh-plugin-hooks","commit":"6cf763e7d6fe59b26937c3e07a17687474018de5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-hooks 的功能「pre-hook」：前置钩子会在匹配的工具运行前执行 shell 命令，并将 JSON 上下文通过 stdin 提供给命令；退出码非零时会拒绝该次工具调用。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:121-155"]}
{"unit_id":"truelove-dreamer__dsh-plugin-hooks#feature-post-hook","repo":"truelove-dreamer/dsh-plugin-hooks","commit":"6cf763e7d6fe59b26937c3e07a17687474018de5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-hooks 的功能「post-hook」：后置钩子在匹配的工具执行结束后运行命令，输入包含工具参数及执行结果；钩子退出状态会记录，但不改变工具结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:157-166"]}
{"unit_id":"truelove-dreamer__dsh-plugin-hooks#feature-config","repo":"truelove-dreamer/dsh-plugin-hooks","commit":"6cf763e7d6fe59b26937c3e07a17687474018de5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-hooks 的功能「config」：钩子可从 DSH_HOME 下的 hooks.json 文件读取，也可在插件挂载配置中内联；配置支持工具筛选、超时和启用开关。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:74-109","lib/config.js:25-49"]}
